1
00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.046 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>难吃</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:06.089 --> 00:00:08.049 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这可不行啊 小姑娘</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:10.552 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你得多学学做饭才行</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:00:10.635 --> 00:00:12.429 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要不然我教教你？</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:16.433 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>天天吃这种东西怎么受得了 剑心？</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:18.309 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没有你说的那么难吃</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:00:18.393 --> 00:00:22.731 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>每次吃薰小姐的菜
都觉得多了一些风味 很不错的</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:26.943 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>说得像什么佳肴似的</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:28.987 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不喜欢吃就别吃啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:31.406 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么嘛 天天来别人家蹭吃蹭喝！</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:00:31.489 --> 00:00:34.034 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不做打手之后就没什么收入了</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:00:34.117 --> 00:00:36.119 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别这么小气嘛</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:40.248 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>很抱歉打扰你们</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:00:40.331 --> 00:00:42.751 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我可以和绯村先生聊聊吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:00:44.043 --> 00:00:45.628 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心 署长来了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:52.343 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村先生 我有一事相求</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:00:52.427 --> 00:00:53.428 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:01:10.278 --> 00:01:13.740 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:02:29.607 --> 00:02:32.986 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说对在下有事相求是指？</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:02:33.069 --> 00:02:36.239 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这件事关乎警察的声誉</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:02:36.865 --> 00:02:40.160 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们已对各报社下达封口令</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:02:40.243 --> 00:02:43.997 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也烦请各位一定要保密</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:48.209 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>其实我们希望绯村先生
帮我们除掉一个凶贼</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:02:48.793 --> 00:02:49.919 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>凶贼？</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:02:51.254 --> 00:02:53.256 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>人称“黑笠”</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:02:53.923 --> 00:02:58.011 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他向许多现在仍居要职的原维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:02:58.094 --> 00:03:01.806 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>发出斩奸状 然后将他们杀害了</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:03:02.348 --> 00:03:07.145 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>十年来他从未失手
是位技艺高超的剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:07.228 --> 00:03:10.523 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他专门杀害维新志士
就是说要么怀恨在心</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:10.607 --> 00:03:13.568 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要么想变革社会了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:03:13.651 --> 00:03:15.194 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有这个可能</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:03:15.778 --> 00:03:20.033 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不仅如此 黑笠以杀人为乐</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:03:20.909 --> 00:03:23.161 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为目标都是身居要职的维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:03:23.244 --> 00:03:25.538 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>警方会提供一流的安保措施</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:03:25.622 --> 00:03:30.752 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>当事人也会不惜权力和金钱聘请保镖</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:03:30.835 --> 00:03:34.339 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是黑笠却还是能突破重重防御</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:03:34.422 --> 00:03:38.259 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>放肆地大杀特杀 似乎乐在其中</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:03:39.052 --> 00:03:42.847 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>两个月前 他在静冈现身时</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:03:42.931 --> 00:03:48.728 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>34名警察和保镖被杀害
56人受了重伤</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:03:48.811 --> 00:03:50.855 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:03:50.939 --> 00:03:54.025 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>其中有持枪的警察 对吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:03:54.108 --> 00:03:56.903 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-对他没用吗？
-这个嘛…</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:03:56.986 --> 00:04:02.742 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>由于某种原因
他们还没来得及拔枪就被全歼了</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:04:02.825 --> 00:04:05.787 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一位死里逃生的幸存者说</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:09.832 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>当时他的手和脚像被绑住了
整个人都动弹不得…</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:14.045 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是二阶堂平法“心之一方”</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:14.128 --> 00:04:15.880 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>咦？</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:15.964 --> 00:04:19.634 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个男人 经历了那么多的杀戮</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:19.717 --> 00:04:23.972 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>心神大概已经
被血的颜色和味道迷惑了</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:24.973 --> 00:04:29.686 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>进入明治已经十多年了
没想到还有这种人</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:30.561 --> 00:04:31.896 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:36.359 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>增派守卫？</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:04:36.442 --> 00:04:38.069 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不必了</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:04:38.152 --> 00:04:40.446 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对手只是一个小小罪犯</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:04:40.530 --> 00:04:43.574 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我连警方的保护都不需要</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:04:43.658 --> 00:04:46.327 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>谷大人 对方可是“黑笠”啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:04:46.411 --> 00:04:48.454 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>注意你的言行！</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:04:48.538 --> 00:04:52.250 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是熬过剑林弹雨
迎来明治新时代的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:04:52.333 --> 00:04:54.419 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>根本不在意一个小小署长的想法</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:04:54.502 --> 00:04:56.629 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那您就应该知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:04:56.713 --> 00:04:59.924 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>拥有杀意的真正剑客是多么的可怕</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:05:00.842 --> 00:05:05.930 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以我才集结了
这么多最强硬汉做我的保镖</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:06.014 --> 00:05:11.894 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们无不钦佩我
陆军总部最强的谷十三郎！</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:05:11.978 --> 00:05:13.354 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:05:13.438 --> 00:05:15.732 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们愿意为谷先生效力</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:05:15.815 --> 00:05:18.860 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们警察老爷还是回家玩泥巴去吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:05:18.943 --> 00:05:20.361 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>说起来</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:05:20.445 --> 00:05:24.490 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你去外面找些来路不明的人帮忙
真是太丢人了</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:05:24.574 --> 00:05:29.329 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还说什么这个外人
比你所有的人手加起来还强？</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:05:30.121 --> 00:05:33.249 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我很惭愧 但的确是这样</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:05:33.333 --> 00:05:34.250 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>咦？</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:05:37.253 --> 00:05:42.216 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>听起来 谷先生
你似乎变成了一个非常自负的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:44.469 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟我在幕末时期的剑林弹雨中</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:05:44.552 --> 00:05:47.513 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>保护的那个人 简直判若两人了</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:05:49.891 --> 00:05:53.311 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说的“最强的硬汉”在哪儿呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:05:53.394 --> 00:05:56.439 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这里的每个家伙我都至少揍过一次</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:05:57.482 --> 00:06:01.360 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟来路不明的保镖待在一起
肯定令人厌烦</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:06:01.444 --> 00:06:04.072 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过就请暂且忍耐一晚吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:06:04.155 --> 00:06:07.658 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是自然！不胜荣幸！</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:06:07.742 --> 00:06:09.202 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们都听到了吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:06:09.285 --> 00:06:13.456 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>今晚就让我们冰释前嫌
一起并肩作战吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:06:13.539 --> 00:06:14.999 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过只有今晚哦</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:20.129 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>谷大人 外面还安排了一队警察
您看可以吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:06:20.213 --> 00:06:21.464 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>少多管闲事！</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:06:22.215 --> 00:06:24.008 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是说太感谢了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:06:30.765 --> 00:06:33.893 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>距离斩奸状上的预定时间
还有五分钟</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:06:34.685 --> 00:06:36.896 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但他真的会来吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:06:38.147 --> 00:06:42.110 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他要是不来 那不是更好吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:06:42.193 --> 00:06:45.321 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我猜小姑娘他们已经睡着了</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:06:45.404 --> 00:06:46.572 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:06:46.656 --> 00:06:51.536 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们好像会早点起来
准备好洗澡水等我们回去</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:06:51.619 --> 00:06:55.623 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是剑心
你为什么接受这份工作呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:06:55.706 --> 00:07:01.129 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我以为你不喜欢被叫去做
这种“拔刀斋”会做的事呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:07:01.212 --> 00:07:02.713 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然 我不喜欢</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:07:03.339 --> 00:07:06.175 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我也没法坐视不理</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:07:06.259 --> 00:07:08.803 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果黑笠不停止他的暴行</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:07:08.886 --> 00:07:10.972 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>会有更多的人受苦</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:07:11.764 --> 00:07:13.933 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也包括黑笠他自己…</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:07:16.227 --> 00:07:20.231 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>话说回来 阿左你又为什么帮忙呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:07:20.314 --> 00:07:22.066 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我当然要来！</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:25.945 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这么激动人心的斗殴
我哪能不参加呢！</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:07:26.028 --> 00:07:28.197 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这可不是斗殴啊…</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:07:28.823 --> 00:07:32.452 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 我还有一个问题想问你</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:07:32.535 --> 00:07:33.411 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么问题？</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:07:34.036 --> 00:07:39.250 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你之前提到的二阶堂平法
“心之一方”到底是什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:07:39.333 --> 00:07:43.379 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>难道你对黑笠那家伙有什么头绪吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:07:43.463 --> 00:07:46.340 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>其实这是两个问题吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:07:46.424 --> 00:07:49.343 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别较真了 快回答我吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:53.139 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-有一个传言
-传言？</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:07:53.723 --> 00:07:56.350 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错 十多年前我听说过一个传言</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:07:56.434 --> 00:07:58.978 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要说头绪的话我有一点 不过…</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:08:01.481 --> 00:08:05.443 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-刚才那声惨叫是怎么回事？
-从外面传来的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:10.531 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他来了！左之助和我走在前面！</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:08:10.615 --> 00:08:12.200 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>其他人紧跟在我们身后！</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:08:12.283 --> 00:08:13.534 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>快！</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:08:16.078 --> 00:08:17.538 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别晃来晃去了 你这肥猪！</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:17.622 --> 00:08:20.708 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这个重要人物
当然应该待在中间了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:08:30.092 --> 00:08:31.260 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一点了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:08:32.136 --> 00:08:33.262 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他没来吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:08:33.346 --> 00:08:36.015 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么啊 吓吓人而已</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:08:42.647 --> 00:08:44.190 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们在这啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:08:44.273 --> 00:08:47.652 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要命的小虫子</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:08:53.574 --> 00:08:55.618 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>睡不着</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:08:55.701 --> 00:08:59.205 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是怎么了？有种奇怪的不安感</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:09:03.334 --> 00:09:06.712 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>毕竟是剑心 肯定会没事的</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:09:06.796 --> 00:09:09.131 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助也跟他在一起</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:09:10.132 --> 00:09:13.094 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你会没事的吧 剑心？</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:09:16.013 --> 00:09:19.058 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一、二、三…</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:09:19.141 --> 00:09:22.395 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们有十四个人还是十五个人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:09:22.478 --> 00:09:24.272 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没我想象的多</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:09:25.273 --> 00:09:27.525 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是黑笠吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:09:27.608 --> 00:09:30.152 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的眼神真是太可怕了</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:09:30.820 --> 00:09:33.823 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左 在下来当他的对手</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:09:33.906 --> 00:09:35.408 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>谷大人就拜托你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:09:36.409 --> 00:09:38.661 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们都傻站着干嘛？</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:09:38.744 --> 00:09:39.954 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>快抓住他！</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:09:40.538 --> 00:09:43.374 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我花了那么多钱雇你们来的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:09:43.457 --> 00:09:44.500 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>给我好好干活啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:09:44.584 --> 00:09:47.628 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>谁要是杀了他 我付五倍报酬！</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:09:47.712 --> 00:09:49.964 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还给他陆军省军官的职位！</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:09:50.047 --> 00:09:51.882 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-五倍报酬！
-陆军军官！</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:09:51.966 --> 00:09:53.050 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好！</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:09:53.134 --> 00:09:56.637 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-这个官我当定了！
-不 非我莫属！</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:09:57.221 --> 00:09:59.932 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一群白痴！
利欲熏心都不要命了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:10:13.070 --> 00:10:15.698 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这种感觉 我喜欢</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:10:15.781 --> 00:10:17.116 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好快的剑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:10:17.199 --> 00:10:21.037 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他不像剑心那样能凌空
但用的剑术很奇怪</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:22.204 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>退后！</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:10:22.288 --> 00:10:24.498 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们根本不是他的对手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:10:24.582 --> 00:10:26.334 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>都别想逃！</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:10:28.127 --> 00:10:30.046 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这…这是怎么回事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:10:30.129 --> 00:10:32.006 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>身体不能动了</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:10:32.089 --> 00:10:34.550 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么能让你们跑了呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:10:34.634 --> 00:10:38.846 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑一旦出鞘 就得拼得你死我活才行</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:10:38.929 --> 00:10:41.474 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不然就没意思了</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:45.519 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这家伙…</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:10:46.187 --> 00:10:47.855 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>到底做了什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:10:48.522 --> 00:10:51.025 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的身体突然变得好沉重</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:10:51.108 --> 00:10:52.401 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦？</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:10:52.485 --> 00:10:55.988 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然有人中了我的
“心之一方”后还能动</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:10:56.739 --> 00:10:58.532 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>“心之一方”！</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:10:58.616 --> 00:11:01.661 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>二阶堂平法“心之一方”</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:11:01.744 --> 00:11:03.704 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>又名“蜷缩之术”</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:11:04.538 --> 00:11:09.335 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真没想到原来你就是黑笠</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:11:15.633 --> 00:11:16.717 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村先生！</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:11:17.551 --> 00:11:23.057 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>幕末时 我在京都
曾经听过关于他的传言</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:11:23.641 --> 00:11:28.479 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个不属于任何藩国
有钱就替人杀人的男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:11:29.605 --> 00:11:33.109 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>据说是二阶堂平法的大师</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:11:33.734 --> 00:11:34.860 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>孤独的刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:11:36.028 --> 00:11:37.405 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>鹈堂刃卫</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:11:41.575 --> 00:11:44.370 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>听说过我吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:11:44.453 --> 00:11:46.872 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也听说过你的故事</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:11:46.956 --> 00:11:48.332 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>使用古剑术飞天御剑流</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:11:48.416 --> 00:11:52.461 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>长州藩的维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:11:52.545 --> 00:11:55.965 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>刽子手绯村拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:11:57.341 --> 00:11:58.759 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:12:00.302 --> 00:12:03.222 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>“心之一方”并不是什么妖术</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:12:03.305 --> 00:12:05.433 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而是剑气之间的较量</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:09.395 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你的剑气和对方一样强
就可以不受影响</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:12:09.979 --> 00:12:14.733 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>去自首吧 刃卫
还是说你想跟在下过几招？</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:12:15.317 --> 00:12:16.735 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟你交手？</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:12:17.820 --> 00:12:20.823 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>求之不得 但是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:12:21.824 --> 00:12:25.202 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要先履行我在斩奸状上的诺言！</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:12:25.286 --> 00:12:28.456 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>糟了！谷大人
快集中精力破解他的秘技！</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:12:28.539 --> 00:12:32.501 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>少废话！
这头烂肥猪绝对不可能破解的了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:12:33.627 --> 00:12:35.796 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-阿左！
-想将我的军</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:37.715 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还早着呢！</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:12:38.757 --> 00:12:39.967 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:12:44.889 --> 00:12:45.931 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫！</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:12:50.978 --> 00:12:52.354 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>能动了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:12:56.025 --> 00:12:57.651 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真有意思</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:12:57.735 --> 00:13:00.529 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>比幕末以来的所有事情都有意思</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:13:00.613 --> 00:13:02.781 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我改变目标了</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:13:02.865 --> 00:13:06.243 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一个猎物就是你 刽子手拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:13:06.327 --> 00:13:10.039 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我很快就会再次出现</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:13:10.122 --> 00:13:15.085 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在那之前 丢掉你这把逆刃刀
准备一把真正的刀吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:13:18.047 --> 00:13:20.257 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你还好吗 阿左？</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:13:20.341 --> 00:13:22.801 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯 这点伤不算什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:13:22.885 --> 00:13:23.886 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村先生！</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:13:23.969 --> 00:13:25.971 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>请尽快为这些人提供急救处理</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:13:26.055 --> 00:13:28.057 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>或许还有救</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:29.183 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:13:29.266 --> 00:13:34.146 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是绯村先生 现在他盯上你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:35.606 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没关系</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:13:35.689 --> 00:13:37.858 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>未尝不是一件好事</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:13:38.442 --> 00:13:39.485 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:13:39.568 --> 00:13:44.448 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>难道你一开始就料到
事情会发展成这样吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:13:45.407 --> 00:13:51.163 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我当然希望事情就此结束
但恐怕没这么简单</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:13:52.039 --> 00:13:53.916 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>黑笠刃卫</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:13:53.999 --> 00:13:56.669 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他没那么容易对付</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:14:06.387 --> 00:14:09.640 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>六人重伤 三人轻伤</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:14:09.723 --> 00:14:13.644 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>黑笠行凶以来
伤亡数这么低还是第一次</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:14:13.727 --> 00:14:16.021 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>说实话 这实在不是值得高兴的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:14:16.105 --> 00:14:17.940 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你别要求太高了</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:14:18.023 --> 00:14:20.985 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没闹出人命来就已经很好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:14:21.569 --> 00:14:23.112 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>顺便问一下</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:14:23.195 --> 00:14:26.657 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>鹈堂刃卫的二阶堂平法到底是什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:14:26.740 --> 00:14:30.911 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>二阶堂平法是一种包含
“一”字、“八”字</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:14:30.995 --> 00:14:34.373 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>“十”字三种姿势的剑术</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:14:34.456 --> 00:14:39.169 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>依次按“一”、“八”、“十”挥剑
就构成一个“平”字</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:14:39.253 --> 00:14:41.964 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>因此得名二阶堂平法</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:14:42.047 --> 00:14:45.634 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这种剑术以奇怪而可怕的奥义而闻名</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:14:45.718 --> 00:14:50.180 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>据说只有剑术的创造者
才会使用奥义“心之一方”</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:14:50.931 --> 00:14:57.813 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>向对手释放压倒性的剑气
让他们动弹不得 是秘技中的秘技</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:14:58.606 --> 00:15:00.649 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我以为他会在交战中使用这招</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:15:00.733 --> 00:15:02.902 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没想到他却用在肆意杀害那些</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:15:02.985 --> 00:15:06.947 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>已经失去战意 试图逃跑的人身上</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:15:07.031 --> 00:15:09.283 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如此残暴…</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:15:09.366 --> 00:15:11.327 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>确实啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:14.413 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我们这边有最强的男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:15:14.496 --> 00:15:18.000 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-所以 大可不用担心啦
-那倒未必</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:15:20.836 --> 00:15:25.799 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在维新后这十年里
在下早已立下誓言不再杀人</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:15:26.425 --> 00:15:30.137 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他却倒行逆施 从未停止杀戮</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:15:31.138 --> 00:15:33.641 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>同是刽子手 却天差地别</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:15:34.642 --> 00:15:38.520 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不知道刃卫
是在何时何地掌握了二阶堂平法</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:15:38.604 --> 00:15:41.231 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但他幕末第一次在京都露面时</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:15:41.315 --> 00:15:43.859 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是新选组的成员</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:15:43.943 --> 00:15:47.821 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>新选组？
那不是幕府最强的剑客集团吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:15:47.905 --> 00:15:49.615 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以他是维新志士的宿敌啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:15:50.407 --> 00:15:54.745 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫确实杀了许多维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:15:54.828 --> 00:15:58.040 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但他也滥杀了很多无辜的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:15:58.123 --> 00:16:05.089 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>因此遭到了组织的肃清
和组织反目成仇 最后脱离了新选组</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:16:05.172 --> 00:16:11.637 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>几个月后他重现江湖 这次却是
以刽子手的身份成了维新志士的伙伴</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:16:12.471 --> 00:16:17.518 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>先支持幕府 又加入倒幕派
他根本不认同任何一种政治理想</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:16:17.601 --> 00:16:21.897 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫有的只是杀戮的欲望罢了</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:16:21.981 --> 00:16:25.901 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只被杀意驱动
真是个穷凶极恶的刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:16:25.985 --> 00:16:28.862 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且还掌握了传说中的奥义</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:16:29.571 --> 00:16:31.865 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这不是我能打的架啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:16:31.949 --> 00:16:34.201 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的目标只有在下一人</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:16:34.284 --> 00:16:36.578 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下来当他唯一的对手</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:16:36.662 --> 00:16:41.625 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过 有件事在下想拜托你</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:16:43.502 --> 00:16:46.922 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是的…好难看的表情</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:16:47.006 --> 00:16:50.092 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>妙龄少女竟然像老奶奶一样
坐着睡着了</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:16:50.175 --> 00:16:53.053 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来她昨晚整夜没合眼吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:16:53.137 --> 00:16:54.179 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦？</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:16:54.263 --> 00:16:56.640 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>小姑娘 醒醒</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:16:57.474 --> 00:16:59.601 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂…醒醒</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:17:03.022 --> 00:17:06.150 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你回来了
-我回来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:17:06.233 --> 00:17:09.111 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下 剑心在哪？</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:17:09.194 --> 00:17:11.113 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心不会回来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:17:13.741 --> 00:17:18.078 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以 这次凶手就追上了他</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:17:18.162 --> 00:17:21.623 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他不在的时候 就由我来照顾你们</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:17:21.707 --> 00:17:23.625 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心去哪了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:17:23.709 --> 00:17:25.502 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他说他要去河边</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:17:26.086 --> 00:17:29.923 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>幕末的刽子手为了进可攻退可守</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:17:30.007 --> 00:17:32.718 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>经常以河边为基地采取行动</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:17:32.801 --> 00:17:35.054 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我去河边的话 刃卫更容易找到我</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:17:35.137 --> 00:17:36.764 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他这么说的</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:17:37.473 --> 00:17:38.640 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 你去哪啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:17:39.433 --> 00:17:41.727 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还用问吗？我去找剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:43.353 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>傻瓜！</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:17:43.437 --> 00:17:45.522 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫不是简单的对手</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:17:45.606 --> 00:17:46.940 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>从我的伤你看不出来吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:17:47.024 --> 00:17:50.527 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你去找他反而会成为他的绊脚石</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:17:50.611 --> 00:17:52.696 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在这里静静地等他 对大家都好…</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:17:52.780 --> 00:17:54.531 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那剑心和刃卫交手后</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:17:54.615 --> 00:17:58.243 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要是再也不回来
又继续去流浪了怎么办？</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:17:58.327 --> 00:18:03.874 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下是浪客
所以可能又要开始浪迹天涯了</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:18:05.584 --> 00:18:11.924 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我父亲去世了 喜兵卫背叛了我
要是剑心也离开我…</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:18:13.801 --> 00:18:17.846 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>与其再一个人孤零零的
我宁愿去直面危险！</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:20.682 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>&lrm;（恶）</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:18:20.766 --> 00:18:24.311 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟剑心分开她就担心的不得了啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:18:24.394 --> 00:18:26.522 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是个任性的小姑娘</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:18:26.605 --> 00:18:31.026 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好吧 有时候
也很难分清任性和爱恋…</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:18:31.110 --> 00:18:33.654 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且她说“一个人孤零零的”</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:18:33.737 --> 00:18:35.864 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你完全被她忽略啦</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:18:35.948 --> 00:18:37.366 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那有什么办法呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:18:37.449 --> 00:18:39.993 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他可是剑心 日本最强的男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:18:40.077 --> 00:18:43.580 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>顺带一提 第二强的是我 明白？</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:18:43.664 --> 00:18:46.792 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那我就是日本第三咯？</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:18:46.875 --> 00:18:50.671 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要去洗个澡睡一觉
后面就拜托你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:18:50.754 --> 00:18:52.631 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心可指望着你呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:18:52.714 --> 00:18:54.675 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你倒是再有责任心一点啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:19:01.974 --> 00:19:04.518 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>上游肯定下了大雨</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:19:04.601 --> 00:19:06.436 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>河水涨了</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:08.605 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>掉进去的话就完了</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:19:11.900 --> 00:19:12.860 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:19:14.903 --> 00:19:17.573 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:19:17.656 --> 00:19:19.867 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>找到你了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:23.579 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>她比刃卫还可怕…</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:26.707 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我听左之助说了</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:29.418 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你暂时不打算回道场了</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:19:31.211 --> 00:19:33.672 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那我也不回去了</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:19:33.755 --> 00:19:34.840 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要和你在一起</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:19:37.593 --> 00:19:41.180 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐 你和左之助吵架了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:19:41.263 --> 00:19:43.515 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-还是和弥彦吵架了？
-都没有</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:19:45.851 --> 00:19:48.103 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你听说刃卫的事了 对吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:19:48.187 --> 00:19:50.480 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>听说了 那我也不回去</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:19:50.564 --> 00:19:53.233 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果我要一边打斗一边保护别人</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:19:54.067 --> 00:19:55.694 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是很难打败刃卫的</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:20:01.575 --> 00:20:02.451 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:20:05.078 --> 00:20:07.623 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是我最喜欢的靛蓝色发带</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:20:07.706 --> 00:20:08.707 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在借给你</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:20:09.583 --> 00:20:11.460 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不用了 我借来也…</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:20:11.543 --> 00:20:13.587 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-叫你借你就借！
-是！</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:16.673 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>说好了？我只是把它借给你</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:20:16.757 --> 00:20:17.799 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一定要好好还给我</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:20:19.968 --> 00:20:21.720 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你和刃卫决斗后</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:20:21.803 --> 00:20:26.558 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不还给我就一个人去流浪了
我是绝对不会原谅你的</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:20:29.311 --> 00:20:32.731 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我明白了 我一定会把它还给你的</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:20:32.814 --> 00:20:34.942 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你就在道场安心等我回来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:20:38.570 --> 00:20:39.446 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那好…</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:20:44.701 --> 00:20:45.911 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
